config BR2_PACKAGE_CAMERA_WEBRTC_DEMO
    bool "Enable Camera WebRTC Demo"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_WEBRTC
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG
    help
      This option enables the Camera WebRTC Demo package, which provides
      a demonstration of streaming video from a camera using WebRTC
      via libpeer, with HTTP-based SDP signaling.
